<title>USA: USDATA says officer resigns.</title>
<headline>USDATA says officer resigns.</headline>
<dateline>RICHARDSON, Texas 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDATA Corp said Wednesday Jay Shipowitz has resigned as senior vice president, finance and administration and CFO to become senior vice president and CFO at ACE Cash Express Inc.</p>
<p>USDATA said it will immediately begin to search for a new CFO.</p>
<p>The company said Shipowitz will remain at USDATA through mid-May.</p>
